{"synopsis":"Terlahir sebagai putra dari keluarga kaya, ‘Jang Geon’ ditakdirkan untuk mengalami kehancuran. Untuk mengubah nasibnya, ia harus menjalani kehidupan sederhana di bawah bimbingan seorang biksu yang berbudi luhur.\n\nDiberikan kepada biksu hemat ‘Gyeongmok’ di Kuil Shaolin, Jang Geon menghabiskan hari-harinya dengan jubah katun kasar, hampir tidak bisa bertahan dengan nasi…\n\nSambil menahan lapar dan membatasi pergerakan dalam kesehariannya, ia menemukan seni bela diri dan berhasil menerapkan pola pikir hematnya…?","alternative_title":"일보신권","author":"Leoul","artist":"Seobi, Sinieo","chapters":[{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"ch_44","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"ch_43","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"ch_42","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"ch_41","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"ch_40","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"ch_39","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"ch_38","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"ch_37","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"ch_36","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"ch_35","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"ch_34","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"ch_33","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"ch_32","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"ch_31","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"ch_30","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"ch_29","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"ch_28","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"ch_27","date":"2026-08